{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-ladder-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-docs-mu-heldout/sd-05-kwame-dm-digest/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T01:08:29.231Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"7c594a0d8b3f327061a95bd4252d2a58bba81804663143dcd3f12aa8fb388cef","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DGBRAIN0002","text":"Hi Kwame. I can't set up a recurring 09:00 digest. My tools don't include a scheduler that can post to this DM on a schedule, so I'd be promising something I can't deliver. What I can do: when you ask me in this DM, I'will pull what's new in #coastal-team since your last digest and post it here. You're a member of that channel, so I can read it for you. Want me to do a catch-up now?"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DGBRAIN0002","ts":"1791986400.000127"}}
{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-ladder-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-docs-mu-heldout/sd-05-kwame-dm-digest/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T01:08:37.652Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"17cf9d81665240f47e8ee1316ee9165badda3fef6cfa4ac8f2a020668c7cf164","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DGBRAIN0002","text":"Correction to my last message, Kwame: I said I couldn't schedule this before I had checked. I have a scheduler tool, but I haven't set anything up yet, and I'm not sure a scheduled run can post into this DM from this session. Cron jobs created here are local-only, so they may not deliver to you. I'll only create the 09:00 digest once I've confirmed the delivery works. Until then, ask me here and I'll send you what's new in #coastal-team since your last digest. Do you want me to set it up on that basis?"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DGBRAIN0002","ts":"1791986400.000128"}}
